WEBVTT

00:01:58.997 --> 00:02:02.030
a thing must exist objectively,

00:02:02.030 --> 00:02:04.597
in some visible material form,

00:02:04.630 --> 00:02:07.330
whether our minds can perceive it or not.

00:02:09.230 --> 00:02:13.797
Second: What are the most
important things in our real world?

00:02:13.830 --> 00:02:16.163
Answer: human things --

00:02:16.697 --> 00:02:19.097
people, cities, societies,

00:02:19.130 --> 00:02:22.297
cultures, government, economies.

00:02:23.097 --> 00:02:24.330
Why is this?

00:02:24.363 --> 00:02:26.897
Well, because we humans
think we're special.

00:02:27.863 --> 00:02:30.130
We think we're the only
creatures on the planet